  "cited_article_id": "search-update-pharmacy-directory",
  "reply": "To add a pharmacy that isn’t in the directory, open the patient’s chart (Patients > Chart > Demographics) and select the Pharmacy tab. Click **Add Custom Pharmacy**, fill in the required fields (Name, Address, Phone, Fax), and press **Save Entry**. Only staff with Medical Assistant or Provider roles can do this. If the new entry doesn’t appear when prescribing, refresh your browser cache (Ctrl+F5 or Cmd+Shift+R) and verify all mandatory address fields were completed."
}
